    {
      "index": 3,
      "status": "intact",
      "assessment": "Pensionnat, ward, secrecy, no communication with friends, and passing as an American are all kept, and the purpose is not revealed. Chapter 005 supports the later reading as a Jane Finn impersonation. Only the supporting rationale about her English past is trimmed (see F2).",
      "evidence": [
        {
