      "status": "intact",
      "assessment": "The revision keeps 'a big man, clean shaven, with a heavy jowl', which supports Tommy's identification of 'a big fat sort of chap. Clean shaven' in chapter 004.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "document": "secret_adversary/003/revision",
          "paragraph": 3,
          "quote": "He was a big man, clean shaven, with a heavy jowl, and small, cunning, shifty eyes."
        },
        {
          "document": "secret_adversary/004/production",
          "paragraph": 15,
          "quote": "One was a big fat sort of chap. Clean shaven, and dark."
        }
      ]
